  "notes": [
    "May add authority (grants, writes, roles or secrets) in: agent-builder, apps-platform, board. Auto-updates accept it; turn them off to review first.",
    "Say a run failed, not the agent, and let the user dismiss it",
    "Send AidenHQ product bugs upstream as issues",
    "Patch, reboot and re-pin over SSH with typed kinds and a durable schedule",
    "Tasks page redesign: one list, Delegated list, task drawer",
    "Connect the user's own Telegram account (TDLib ingest, triage, reviewed sends)",
    "Read servers over SSH and publish one status row each",
    "Act as the GitHub App wherever it is installed and permitted, as the owner elsewhere",
    "Declare the module and serve its config page",
    "A key field kind and checked clears for named-secret entries",
    "Days reset at midnight in the owner's timezone",
    "Dispatch-only repo hooks, ignored automation accounts, CI-owned generated files",
    "Automatic triage: place, close on evidence, stale to Later",
    "Each module keeps its own repo list; pull requests are Ship's",
    "One-line Home rows with hover actions; richer detail drawer",
    "Home rows Needs you | Waiting on, Today | Since; meeting links",
    "Needs you beside Since you last looked; remove ideas",
    "12-hour time by default, time_format setting",
    "Simpler per-repo settings",
    "People waiting on you in Needs you; Since and Idea side by side"
  ],
  "release": "2026.11.28"
}
